cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, its models, or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Step-Type Prediction from EEG Signals"
abstract: >-
  A per-participant nested cross-validation pipeline that classifies step type
  (straight vs diagonal) from EEG contingent negative variation (CNV) signals,
  using classical (XGBoost) and neural (CNN/EEGNet) models. Developed as an MSc
  thesis project.
